OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMostly cloudy day with rain and
OL,6,Fshowers as Storm Austen moves east.
OL,7,FStrongest winds likely through the
OL,8,Fafternoon, with gales, as rain clears
OL,9,Feast. Drier and brighter later in west.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloudy with showers and rain
OL,12,Fin the east, becoming more settled and
OL,13,Fdrier overnight with clearing skies
OL,14,Ffrom the west. Winds will ease
OL,15,Fslightly by the morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
