OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FCool start Saturday, but
OL,6,Fturning wet and windy with rain
OL,7,Fspreading east from mid-morning,
OL,8,Fbecoming heavy at times. Winds will
OL,9,Fincrease and become breezy with
OL,10,Fcoastal gales.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FWindy
OL,13,FSunday with showers and brighter
OL,14,Fintervals. Briefly drier overnight,
OL,15,Fbefore further rain and stronger winds
OL,16,Farrive Monday. Unsettled on Tuesday
OL,17,Fwith rain and showers, blustery winds.
OL,18,FTemperatures around average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
